  "title": "Cream of Fiddlehead Soup",
  "description": "This fiddlehead soup, with cream, butter, stock, onion, garlic, potato, and carrot is a must in early spring when fresh fiddleheads are in season.",
  "authors": [
    "Boomer"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T10:09:17-04:00",
